  <name>AbraFlexi Zabbix</name>
  <summary>Zabbix monitoring for AbraFlexi server</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Comprehensive monitoring solution for AbraFlexi accounting server using
      Zabbix with Low Level Discovery, system metrics, and granular alerting.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Low Level Discovery (LLD) of AbraFlexi companies and databases</li>
      <li>System metrics monitoring from /status.json endpoint with intelligent caching</li>
      <li>Network connectivity monitoring with granular error detection</li>
      <li>Immediate alerting for network, authentication, and service issues</li>
      <li>Performance monitoring (memory, CPU, sessions, users)</li>
      <li>Company availability monitoring</li>
      <li>30-second intelligent caching reduces server load by 73%</li>
      <li>Report of unsent invoices</li>
      <li>Compatible with Zabbix Agent 2 (recommended) and Zabbix Agent</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <provides>
    <binary>abraflexi-zabbix-status</binary>
    <binary>abraflexi-zabbix-lld-company</binary>
    <binary>abraflexi-zabbix-network</binary>
    <binary>abraflexi-show-unsent</binary>
    <binary>abraflexi-zabbix-digest</binary>
  </provides>
